<title>PERU: Southern Peru Q1 net profit rises 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Southern Peru Q1 net profit rises 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - 0.39 sol vs 0.29 sol</p>
<p>Net - 157.4 million soles vs 115.7 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 556.4 million soles vs 509.6 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Peru's largest miner, Southern Peru Copper Ltd is 54.1 pct owned by ASARCO Inc and 13.9 percent owned by Phelps Dodge Corp.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
